   "source": {
    "label": "thm:fullAlg",
    "number": "Theorem 3",
    "quote": "The expected regret of $\\alg{Skipper}(\\beta, \\alg{DEW}(\\eta,\\beta))$ against an oblivious adversary satisfies \\bar{\\mathcal{R}}_{T} \\leq \\vert S_{\\beta} \\vert + \\max \\left \\{ \\frac{\\ln K}{\\eta}, 4e \\beta \\ln K \\right \\} + \\eta \\left ( \\frac{KTe}{2}+ D_{\\beta} \\right), where $D_{\\beta} = \\sum_{t \\notin S_{\\beta}} d_{t}$ is the cumulative delay experienced by \\alg{DEW}."
